00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.840
Oh, I feel bad for you.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.160
Because

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.280
Mason’s greatest passion is his work.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:44.080
Oh, no.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.760
That's all in the best.

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.440
Now, I am a loyal partner

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:50.480
to his brother.

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.280
Here he is!

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:03.240
I need to take this.

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:04.520
That's important.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:07.160
Not now, please.

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.080
Hey hey, honey-bunny.

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:11.760
Look at you.

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.120
